<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to buy 25,000/T, Sept 11-15 fuel oil.</title>
<headline>India tenders to buy 25,000/T, Sept 11-15 fuel oil.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued a tender to buy 25,000 tonnes of high sulphur fuel oil for delivery between Sept 11-15, industry sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks a cargo of 180-centistoke grade, 3.5-percent sulphur grade fuel for delivery to Goa or Kandla on the Indian west coast.</p>
<p>The tender closes August 29 and will be valid for one day.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
